  "_doc": "1st Cavalry Division — the player's pack. Self-contained folder: this manifest + names.json (+ crests/audio under public/ until the runtime loader serves pack folders directly). `catalogs.extends` pulls the shared US platform library; a total-conversion pack would inline its own tables instead.",
